  unitName: Star King Nekky
  unitId: 50224
  unitNumber: 252
  description: Rumored to live somewhere in Grand Gaia on an island called "Famitsu
    Island," Nekky departed in search of "What truly makes something fun." The heroic
    tales of how he traveled around vanquishing monsters who dared peddle fake amusements
    are still tremendously popular with boys and girls today. He would often say,
    "Let's continue our search for the greatest game ever!"*Nekky is the mascot for
    Famitsu, Japan's No. 1 game media outlet.
  summonDesc: 0
  fusionDesc: I can feel your<br>presence all around me!<br>You've got true potential!
  evoDesc: Thank you!<br>I appreciate your thoughts!<br>Please summon me anytime!
